          "source_url": "https://www.01vc.com/",
          "source_title": "零一创投官方网站｜投资领域：物流科技",
          "source_content_hash": "0428ebce0331e8532734ede4a2cfc43d540be193914e9d5e04c4c2d9b8d58a61",
          "quote": "我们深耕物流科技近十年。",
          "quote_hash": "01b151cc3205b7a70b80261346fe4f59a3fcc20ca84a4285727c1efed89472cd"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "o1vc_industry_internet",
