          "source_content_hash": "0428ebce0331e8532734ede4a2cfc43d540be193914e9d5e04c4c2d9b8d58a61",
          "quote": "我们自机构成立之初就重点关注产业互联网的整体机会。",
          "quote_hash": "f2c2676f289772572fc4a454ce8fe730577c53e9dee1a1af855c0d767a5d6157"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "o1vc_robotics",
